      "locked": false,
      "text": "Docker reuses a step (CACHED) only\nif the step and everything before it\nare exactly the same as last time.\n\nSo: things that rarely change go\nfirst (installing packages). Things\nyou change all the time go last\n(your code).",
      "originalText": "Docker reuses a step (CACHED) only\nif the step and everything before it\nare exactly the same as last time.\n\nSo: things that rarely change go\nfirst (installing packages). Things\nyou change all the time go last\n(your code).",
